@FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5124

### Criar título
# @name createAsset
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CDB Banco XYZ",
  "issuer": "Banco XYZ",
  "assetType": "Cdb",
  "indexType": "PreFixed",
  "rate": 12,
  "issueDate": "2025-01-01",
  "maturityDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### Listar títulos
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Accept: application/json

### Detalhar título
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets/{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar título
PUT {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets/{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CDB Banco XYZ Prefixado",
  "issuer": "Banco XYZ",
  "rate": 13,
  "issueDate": "2025-01-01",
  "maturityDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### Registrar aporte
# @name createPosition
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": "{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "investedAmount": 1000,
  "applicationDate": "2025-06-01"
}

### Listar aportes
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions
Accept: application/json

### Projeção do aporte
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions/{{createPosition.response.body.$.data.id}}/projection?referenceDate=2026-06-01
Accept: application/json

### Remover título (rejeitado: título já possui aportes)
DELETE {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets/{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Resumo consolidado da carteira
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/summary?referenceDate=2026-06-01
Accept: application/json

###
